I'm organizing the spice levels with Chakalaka as the mildest at level 1, followed by Langer Pfeffer at 2, and Bird's Eye Chili at 3, even though the packaging suggests a different rating—I'll go with what the user specified. For the German text, I'm using "Wähle deinen Schärfegrad" for "Choose your spice level," and I'll apply that bold comic-style font from the reference image. I'm settling on the German text "WÄHLE DEINEN SCHÄRFEGRAD" since it matches their existing product labeling, then I'll structure a clean directive prompt with the upload order and reference roles clearly marked for the composite layout.

